{
  "name" : "Rao2014 - Fatty acid beta-oxidation (reduced model)",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This represents the reduced version of the \"time course model\" of Van Eunen et al (2013): Biochemical competition makes fatty-acid beta-oxidation vulnerable to substrate overload. The SBML was created from that of the original model and produces identical results when a time-course of 25 mins is run in COPASI</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
